IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SQ-WMQ-GALOIS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 VOCAB-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TEMP-SCALE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SQ-WMQ-GALOIS.
    IF VOCAB-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 64 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 1245 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 VOCAB-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
